								We use AI too, and we know how fast the meter runs. So the Coach finds and fixes most issues with
								<strong>no model call at all</strong>; when the AI does write, Lattice <strong>caches the
								instructions</strong> and sends a <strong>compact catalog</strong> instead of a wall of docs.
							</p>
							<p class="m-0 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-foreground">
								Pick a model with its <strong>live price</strong> in front of you, set a <strong>session
								budget</strong> — Lattice warns at 80% and can stop at 100% — and your spend and balance stay on
								screen the whole time. No surprise invoice.
							</p>
